m{NormedSpace}_S(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(H)\\)</span> (designated normed-space structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}\">\\(\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}\\)</span> (operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed\" href=\"?note=5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-operator.md\">../batch07/58-df-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaUnboundedOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaUnboundedOperator}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaUnboundedOperator}_S(T,H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(H)\\land\\operatorname{Operator}_{K_H}(T;\\operatorname{dom}(T),H,H)\\land \\forall C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\exists x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_H&gt;C\\|x\\|_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaUnboundedOperator}_S(T,H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(H)\\land\\operatorname{Operator}_{K_H}(T;\\operatorname{dom}(T),H,H)\\land \\forall C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\exists x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_H&gt;C\\|x\\|_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient normed structure is now required explicitly; without it, the norms and scalar field in the former assertion had no source.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"i